ortfolio construction and rebalancing. 5. **Governance**: Covers audit trails,\ explainability, and risk guardrails. Arrows indicate the flow from data sources through the pipeline, AI modules, human feedback, and governance.)/K 3/P 14261 0 R/Pg 697 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj14279 0 obj<</K[4 15069 0 R 6]/P 14261 0 R/Pg 697 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj14280 0 obj<</K[7 15067 0 R 9]/P 14261 0 R/Pg 697 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj14281 0 obj<</K[15014 0 R 15015 0 R 15016 0 R 15017 0 R 15018 0 R]/P 14261 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj14282 0 obj<</K[14986 0 R 14987 0 R 14988 0 R]/P 14261 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj14283 0 obj<</K 5/P 14261 0 R/Pg 704 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj14284 0 obj<</K[6 14982 0 R 8 14983 0 R 10]/P 14261 0 R/Pg 704 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj14285 0 obj<</K 12/P 14261 0 R/Pg 704 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj14286 0 obj<</K 13/P 14261 0 R/Pg 704 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj14287 0 obj<</K[14959 0 R 14960 0 R 14961 0 R]/P 14261 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj14288 0 obj<</A 14958 0 R/Alt(Flow chart illustrating a data processing pipeline with potential security vulnerabilities. The sequence includes: Client App \(User Interface\),Ž API Gateway \(Endpoints\),Ž Cloud Infrastructure \(Storage &amp; Compute\),Ž Data Pipeline \(lakes &amp;\ feeds\),Ž ML Model \(Portfolio Logic\),Ž and Defi Connector \(Smart Contracts\).Ž Highlighted risks are: API Abuse: Weak authentication, excessive data,Ž Cloud Misconfiguration: Leaked keys, open storage,Ž Data Poisoning: Injected fake market data,Ž\ Adversarial Inputs: Manipulated real-time signals,Ž and Oracle/Defi Manipulation: Fake prices, flash loans.Ž)/K 17/P 14261 0 R/Pg 704 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj14289 0 obj<</K 14957 0 R/P 14261 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj14290 0 obj<</K[14918 0 R 14919 0 R 14920 0 R]/P 14261 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj14291 0 obj<</K 48/P 14261 0 R/Pg 709 0 R/S/P/Type